ction class=\"section alt\" id=\"amenities\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Bueno saber</p><h2>Servicios y políticas</h2></div><ul class=\"amenities\"><li><b>Reserva en línea</b><span>Todos los barberos aceptan citas en línea</span></li><li><b>Domingos solo con cita</b></li><li><b>Accesible en silla de ruedas</b></li><li><b>Aceptamos tarjetas de crédito</b></li><li><b>Wi-Fi gratis</b></li><li><b>Estacionamiento</b><span>También para bicicletas</span></li><li><b>Ideal para niños</b></li><li><b>Precios para mayores y militares</b><span>Varios barberos tienen precios para mayores de 65 y para militares/socorristas</span></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Galería</p><h2>Dentro de Marty&#39;s</h2></div><div class=\"gallery\"><figure><img src=\"images/shop-floor.jpg\" alt=\"Estaciones de barbero dentro de Marty&#39;s\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/taper.jpg\" alt=\"Low taper fade\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/hot-towel-shave.jpg\" alt=\"Afeitado con toalla caliente\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/fade.jpg\" alt=\"Fade recién hecho\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/beard.jpg\" alt=\"Recorte y delineado de barba\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/side-part.jpg\" alt=\"Raya al lado con fade\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/kids-fade.jpg\" alt=\"Fade para niño\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/team.jpg\" alt=\"Barberos en la entrada de la barbería\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Reseñas</p><h2>Lo que dicen nuestros clientes</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.9</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Google</b> · 176 reseñas</div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/Marty%27s+Barbershop/@38.334085,-121.954199,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x80853d18bfa90d17:0x87e0c0043f59cd49!8m2!3d38.334085!4d-121.954199!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lee más reseñas en Google →</a></div></div><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.9</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Booksy</b> · 1332 reseñas</div><a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1040320_martys-barbershop_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lee más reseñas en Booksy →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Marty’s Barbershop delivers excellent service in a professional and welcoming environment. Marty is highly skilled, consistent and provides great hospitality. My Barber, Foofades is also outstanding, with great attention to detail and overall an amazing guy to talk to.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Marty%27s%20Barbershop%202611%20Nut%20Tree%20Rd%20Ste%20E%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Feb 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Best barber out in Vacaville, never disappointed me every time I came in🫡💯”</blockquote><figcaption>— Jaden · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/263621_martythebarber_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Oct 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I was literally walking out of my doctors appointment thinking about looking for a barber when I crossed paths with the owner. He brought me in and the vibes were amazing. Great people, amazing skills and overall amazing experience. It didn’t feel like going in to just get a cut. I got an experience.You gotta get a fresh cut from these guys.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Marty%27s%20Barbershop%202611%20Nut%20Tree%20Rd%20Ste%20E%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Feb 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Viv does an amazing job! She’s thorough, detail-oriented, and listens to her clients. Every haircut I’ve gotten from her is great and grows out well between cuts!!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Kendra · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/658054_hercuts_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · May 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Thank you, Hudson for making our first experience at this barbershop and with you great! It is evident you take pride in your craft and the results show for itself. We are very satisfied with our son’s haircut by you. I definitely recommend booking with him. Thank you!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Marty%27s%20Barbershop%202611%20Nut%20Tree%20Rd%20Ste%20E%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Dec 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Jared always does a great job. Great attention to Detail and many years of experience. If you’re looking for a new barber,Jared is the guy. He’s been cutting my hair for over 10 years.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Bradley · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1694168_thatboy-reezy_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Oct 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“He cut my haircut like how I imagined it. Takes his time and doesn’t rush. Cleanest skin mid fade in the area”</blockquote><figcaption>— Nish · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/966669_joe-big-money-lopez_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Sep 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Carlos provided a great cut along with efficient timing, I would highly recommend his services!👌🏽”</blockquote><figcaption>— Emani · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/593463_losblendzz_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Aug 2026</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“10/10 recommend this shop! Marty cuts my sons hair an always is quick, smooth and always makes my sons experience exceptional. If your not getting your hair cut here your missing out.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=Marty%27s%20Barbershop%202611%20Nut%20Tree%20Rd%20Ste%20E%20Vacaville%20CA%2095687\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Nov 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><blockquote>“Great haircut, Good convo &amp; Good vibes. Eli got me right. Thanks!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Alex024 · <a href=\"https://booksy.com/en-us/1244424_fadezbyeli-martysbarbershop_barber-shop_134729_vacaville\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Booksy</a> · Aug 2026</figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Preguntas frecuentes</p><h2>Tus preguntas, respondidas</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>¿Necesito cita?</summary><p>Puedes reservar con cualquiera de nosotros en línea. Los domingos son solo con cita, y entre semana y los sábados también atendemos sin cita.</p></details><details><summary>¿Cuánto cuesta un corte?</summary><p>Un corte estándar cuesta $40–$50, según el barbero. Revisa la página de reservas de tu barbero para ver los precios actuales.</p></details><details><summary>¿Tienen descuentos para mayores o militares?</summary><p>Sí. Varios de nuestros barberos ofrecen cortes para mayores (65+) a $30 y para militares/socorristas a $35–$40.</p></details><details><summary>¿Hacen afeitado con toalla caliente?</summary><p>¡Claro que sí! Marty hace afeitado tradicional por $40, y corte más afeitado tradicional con toalla caliente por $75. Viviana y Joe también hacen afeitados tradicionales con navaja.</p></details><details><summary>¿Aceptan tarjetas?</summary><p>Sí, aceptamos tarjetas.</p></details><details><summary>¿Hay Wi-Fi y acceso para sillas de ruedas?</summary><p>Sí. Tenemos Wi-Fi gratis y la barbería es accesible en silla de ruedas.</p></details><details><summary>¿Cuál es el horario?</summary><p>Abrimos lun–vie de 9 AM a 6 PM y sáb de 9 AM a 3 PM. Los domingos solo con cita.</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">Visítanos</p>\n      <h2>Horario y ubicación</h2>\n      <address>2611 Nut Tree Rd Ste E<br>Vacaville, CA 95687</address>\n      <p><a class=\"phone-link\" href=\"tel:+17076608108\">(707) 660-8108</a></p>\n      <table class=\"hours\" id=\"hoursTable\"><tr data-d=\"1\"><td>Lunes</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"2\"><td>Martes</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"3\"><td>Miércoles</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"4\"><td>Jueves</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"5\"><td>Viernes</td><td>9 AM – 6 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"6\"><td>Sábado</td><td>9 AM – 3 PM</td></tr><tr data-d=\"0\"><td>Domingo</td><td>Cerrado</td></tr></table>\n      <p class=\"note\">Los domingos solo con cita.</p>\n      <div class=\"socials\"><a class=\"social\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/martysbarbershop_/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M7 2h10a5 5 0 0 1 5 5v10a5 5 0 0 1-5 5H7a5 5 0 0 1-5-5V7a5 5 0 0 1 5-5zm5 5a5 5 0 1 0 0 10 5 5 0 0 0 0-10z